  <section class="section shell article-content">
    <h2>Aurora OS</h2>
    <p class="content-copy">There is no public installer, system image or supported-hardware list. Do not install unofficial files claiming to be Aurora releases.</p>
    <h2>Lumen Browser</h2>
    <p class="content-copy">Lumen is also in development. There is no public browser download yet.</p>
    <h2>When will downloads appear?</h2>
    <p class="content-copy">Official downloads will be published here when a release is ready, together with supported-platform information and installation instructions.</p>
